<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	12.00 /11.00  12.25 /11.75    12.55 /12.00</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.50 /11.00  12.00 /11.75    12.50 /12.00</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  12.20 /11.95  12.50 /12.375   12.75 /12.50</p>
<p>Metrobank		12.25 /11.25  12.75 /11.55    13.75 /12.725</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.375/10.90  12.00 /11.50    12.375/11.80</p>
<p>PNB			11.80 /11.70  12.00 /11.90    12.50 /12.40</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   12.50 /12.00  12.75 /12.25    13.75 /12.75</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
